{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007_03_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d735317fc074598b4036684fdd9a2a0484908f4e2028dee4d886916839bb30c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2de80108f59e37fa0e9a84cc00a32a1339bbd53960db56a604f353852de7a2cb",
      "text": "接下来，能请清澄九郎先生先讲讲，\n作为偶像您能展现怎样的魅力吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a958e6bc29230f14dbe2762fdcddd00ad9270bece6bb60e42f108d230af168f0",
      "text": "（根据之前制作人向我介绍的\n偶像活动，现在的我能做到的事……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87396086bd29f59661eb58414db5325e86567fdedd89e16fabbd3eca3894487e",
      "text": "好的。\n我打算通过茶道与广大群众展开交流。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14ad210f04dea375c9740966e33588afc58a9d6cd876f9869f1c87e3432a890a",
      "text": "或许您会觉得，\n这与至今为止的活动有何不同。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ae7a3599ee28d2d684e97ae45b51eed18d7f888aecf5f4ea83e87215f2fd76b",
      "text": "但是，我认为作为偶像能做的事，\n与作为茶道家能做的事是截然不同的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:075789d526b69140a820a5c988e43d52e9846148e8b622205422a5ad39ad4c6a",
      "text": "茶道家点茶，恐怕并不能带来多少惊奇。\n但如果是偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e198df15ed752d985ec62802ff8cff07d32c387e5da7c048048e4dccc9bd5b",
      "text": "平时唱歌跳舞的偶像点茶并传达\n“侘寂”之美。那一定会留下极其深刻的印象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b91a7e323731b7647b91c407fe99c0d58efc27a50a08f286fa0925610bc23563",
      "text": "清澄九郎先生，非常感谢。\n华村翔真先生觉得如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ab52849882e53e4779111e26529cce0885bd8d1b11df97b45f2da512594daf0",
      "text": "我嘛，就活用曾是歌舞伎演员这一点咯。\n话题度肯定是有的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d242f1212cc4ea8f05580240951c0df6056896491b194f7c3accaf2833a97f",
      "text": "而且，我在演艺圈既有经验也有知名度，\n关键时刻还有人脉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abc04e53544fccb7d299dab822f3492f12966c4fb085f74d3982da87378bca1d",
      "text": "能作为即战力为事务所做出贡献哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56f2c02efbe4421657200645c00b0e02a6abf059261f932fc3b1a1b27119ff95",
      "text": "（用不用得上另当别论，\n我手里的筹码尽量先亮出来才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c13bf96565b3b38ad88fb0712cc9fa38dd2b2952da46f8537991fbfe9e10863e",
      "text": "（为了能成为偶像，站在那里）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_03_1_1_007_03:1_1_007_03_d:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:748cc81ee693cc25d92a9460f3ed5ededc83dece17edf9c523bb8d1c1813e2ec",
      "text": "（演艺界的经验……是我目前尚有所欠缺的\n部分。华村先生果然很厉害呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
